    <h2>Fact sheet</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Pricing:</strong> $175 a month, flat, with $0 down and a 12-month minimum. An extra page beyond the 10 included costs $100 per page, and other work outside the plan costs $100 an hour, with a written estimate first.</li>
      <li><strong>Tools:</strong> sites built ahead of time from plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, with no framework, and served from a fast global network.</li>
      <li><strong>Performance target:</strong> 95 to 100 on Google's speed test for every page, on mobile and desktop.</li>
      <li><strong>Accessibility:</strong> meets WCAG 2.2 AA at minimum, checked with automated accessibility tests and by hand with a screen reader before every launch.</li>
      <li><strong>Coverage:</strong> all 50 U.S. states and 10 Canadian provinces, fully remote.</li>
      <li><strong>Trades served:</strong> HVAC, plumbing, electrical, roofing, home inspection, commercial inspection, landscaping, general contracting, restoration, and related service businesses.</li>
      <li><strong>Discount programs:</strong> a free second month for <a href="/discounts/#veterans" class="inline-link">veterans</a>, <a href="/discounts/#first-responders" class="inline-link">first responders</a>, and <a href="/discounts/#medical" class="inline-link">medical professionals</a>, plus their immediate family.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Available for</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Podcast appearances.</strong> Trade, small-business marketing, and web design podcasts, for 30 to 60 minutes, on any show whose listeners run service businesses.</li>
      <li><strong>Contributed articles.</strong> For trade publications, business journals, and industry newsletters read by small-business owners. Pitch a topic, and I'll write it to a fixed deadline.</li>
      <li><strong>Quote requests.</strong> Same-day replies by email. Every quote is specific, on the record, and attributable.</li>
    </ul>

